 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## View preservation
+
+The client router retains the active page and up to four recently visited page
+views in a persistent main container. Returning to a cached path and query string
+reuses its DOM nodes and component state. Inactive views are hidden and inert;
+the least recently used view is removed when the cache fills. Hash navigation
+continues to use Astro's normal scroll behavior.
+
+Navigation still fetches the destination so its head, title, and styles stay up to
+date. Replace navigations refresh the destination view. A full reload resets the
+cache. Sign-in and sign-up use `cacheView={false}` to clear cached content and
+discard their forms when leaving. Other pages can opt out with the same Layout prop.
